Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:26.93,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:29.28,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.44,0:00:44.77,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,So it looks like this year's energy is fading away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.87,0:00:50.98,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow we don't have school, so can we see the flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.25,0:00:56.52,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds fun! I'll prepare some food!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.67,0:00:58.98,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.98,0:01:00.50,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.98,0:01:00.50,Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:02.10,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.45,0:01:08.91,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sorry, I decided everything by myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.91,0:01:12.46,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. It's no problem for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.46,0:01:14.27,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.27,0:01:16.01,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.47,0:01:26.52,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki is always causing trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.52,0:01:29.05,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:32.34,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.76,0:01:37.41,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow, let's meet up at the park!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.41,0:01:38.16,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.59,0:01:40.14,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:41.54,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,So, 9 o' clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:44.12,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The flowers won't open until noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:46.34,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,So, 10 o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:49.33,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I might miss GranSazers...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.33,0:01:52.80,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's meet at noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.39,0:02:00.83,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.91,0:02:04.02,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are the sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.99,0:02:06.71,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't they below the sink?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.71,0:02:07.79,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.78,0:02:11.86,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It might rain tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:16.90,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,They said it'll be a spring storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:18.40,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Storm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.37,0:02:24.12,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It's already raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.13,0:02:29.19,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It's really raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.37,0:02:34.00,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we make some charms against the rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:02:58.13,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:03.94,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The rain stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:06.24,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.91,0:03:09.21,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The {\i1}teru teru bouzu{\i0} saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.99,0:03:18.38,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,They fell off because of the storm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:28.68,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,What a green smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.14,0:03:40.06,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The flowers disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:42.88,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:44.66,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.46,0:04:01.01,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.81,0:04:31.61,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,They're in full bloom in the sky!
